# The image is built from source, and only these paths are source it needs. The
# rest of the tree (specs/ alone is 45 MB, .git 21 MB) is context that would be
# sent to the daemon and invalidate the layer cache on every unrelated change.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd
!internal
!behavior
!profiles
!scripts/slim-overlay.py
**/*_test.go
**/testdata
